@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+A new method, :meth:`falcon.App.set_error_reporter` (and its ASGI counterpart,
+:meth:`falcon.asgi.App.set_error_reporter`), was added in order to make it
+possible to observe every exception raised while the framework is processing a
+request, e.g., to log it or to forward it to an error tracker. The reporter
+is called with the request, the exception, the responder params, and a flag
+indicating whether the exception is handled by an
+:meth:`error handler <falcon.App.add_error_handler>`, or is going to be
+propagated to the application server.
